# Private skills. These stay on disk and remain usable locally through the
# ~/.claude/skills junction, but this repository is public, so they are never
# tracked or published. Do not re-add one to git to "fix" a missing skill.
#
# job-search was renamed from pdev on 2026-08-11 (the codename only existed to
# hide it from coworkers, which this home setup does not need). The old path is
# kept ignored as well: it costs nothing, and this entry is a privacy control -
# if a stale pdev/ ever reappears from a backup or another machine, it must not
# become trackable just because the name moved on.
skills/job-search/
skills/pdev/
